  nodeId: CO - Page 5
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>Visuals</b>\r\nHard cut from Thomas's run \u2014 no time skip, this
    is the same night. The palette drains to cold and dreary. Detective Miller is
    already standing outside the yellow tape under flashing blue lights, called to
    the scene the moment the case was flagged for his and the investigator's joint
    assignment.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>No. of Panels: 1</i>\r\n\r"
